        f"(i) The recorded `tests_passed` row above attests the suite run at its own head H={h[:12]}, NOT\n"
        f"    the subject M={m[:12]} — it is NOT relabelled as covering M.\n"
        "(ii) The delta H..M is churn-only by `_concurrent_merge_churn_only` (the ONE churn classifier,\n"
        "    SPEC-0165): already-landed main history merged into the branch — sibling-authored content\n"
        "    that each sibling's own land already verified and integrated — plus lifecycle bookkeeping;\n"
        "    NOTHING authored on THIS branch since H.\n"
        "(iii) A Stage-6 row for M CANNOT pre-exist this audit: M is the merge sha this land created after\n"
        "    its reservation wait, and M's OWN suite run is land's mandatory candidate verify, which runs\n"
        "    AFTER this audit over this exact merged tree and gates the ff to main — a failing M aborts the\n"
        "    land whatever this verdict says (the same deferred-evidence ordering the --land-emitted-event /\n"
        "    --serve-deploy overlays name).\n"
        "(iv) Therefore the sha gap between the row and M is the ORDERING of a land, not missing proof, and\n"
        "    is NOT by itself a test-evidence finding for THIS audit. Judge the Stage-6 evidence on its own\n"
        "    terms — the recorded acceptance-at-test against the criteria: a missing row, or evidence that\n"
