#: INSIDE its episode (B6), so the carrier is keyed on `(episode_id, finding_id)` and never on the id
#: alone — two episodes each allocating a deferrable `B1` must file TWO carriers.
CONSULT_SUCCESSOR_PREFIX = audit_consult.CONSULT_SUCCESSOR_PREFIX  # T-12696: moved module-local into the leaf (exclusive to the consult movers)

